                    name = {"香奈"},
                    "「有时候，蠢货意识不到这一点，仗着旧相识的名头随口搭话，可",
                    {"rt2"},
                    "对话根本不可能有交集」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00101",
        linknext = "block_00103"
    },
    block_00103 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            vo = {
                {"vo", file = "fem_knd_000757", ch = "knd"}
            },
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"香奈"},
                    "「世界级的艺术家和地方私立学校的美术讲师……。草薙君和御樱",
                    {"rt2"},
                    "同学之间，如今毫无交集，也是理所当然的吧……」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00102",
        linknext = "block_00104"
    },
    block_00104 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"直哉"},
                    "「嗯，是啊」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00103",
        linknext = "block_00105"
    },
    block_00105 = {
        {"bg", file = "ev_com_j04_04", sync = 0, face = 1, time = 400, path = ":ev/ev_com_j04/", set = "ev_com_j04"},
        {"text"},
        text = {
            vo = {
                {"vo", file = "fem_knd_000758", ch = "knd"}
            },
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"香奈"},
                    "「但我不一样」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00104",
        linknext = "block_00106"
    },
    block_00106 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            vo = {
                {"vo", file = "fem_knd_000759", ch = "knd"}
            },
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"香奈"},
                    "「我们啊，总有一天要超越御樱禀」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00105",
        linknext = "block_00107"
    },
    block_00107 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"直哉"},
                    "「超越御樱禀……。你到现在还在说这种话啊……」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00106",
        linknext = "block_00108"
    },
    block_00108 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            vo = {
                {"vo", file = "fem_knd_000760", ch = "knd"}
            },
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"香奈"},
                    "「当然，我可是为了这个才一路拼过来的」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00107",
        linknext = "block_00109"
    },
    block_00109 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"直哉"},
                    "「你们的那份努力，在我看来只不过是在挑衅世人？」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00108",
        linknext = "block_00110"
    },
    block_00110 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            vo = {
                {"vo", file = "fem_knd_000761", ch = "knd"}
            },
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"香奈"},
                    "「那和草薙健一郎有什么不同？　和那位御樱禀又有什么不同？」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00109",
        linknext = "block_00111"
    },
    block_00111 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            vo = {
                {"vo", file = "fem_knd_000762", ch = "knd"}
            },
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"香奈"},
                    "「御樱禀不也是，单凭年轻和貌美就博足了眼球，靠着一点小小的",
                    {"rt2"},
                    "差错才得的奖吗」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00110",
        linknext = "block_00112"
    },
    block_00112 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"直哉"},
                    "「小小的差错？　蠢货……那既不是差错，也不是别的什么」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00111",
        linknext = "block_00113"
    },
    block_00113 = {
        {"bg", file = "ev_com_j04_03", sync = 0, face = 1, time = 400, path = ":ev/ev_com_j04/", set = "ev_com_j04"},
        {"text"},
        text = {
            vo = {
                {"vo", file = "fem_knd_000763", ch = "knd"}
            },
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"香奈"},
                    "「我知道」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00112",
        linknext = "block_00114"
    },
    block_00114 = {
        {"bg", file = "ev_com_j04_04", sync = 0, face = 1, time = 400, path = ":ev/ev_com_j04/", set = "ev_com_j04"},
        {"text"},
        text = {
            vo = {
                {"vo", file = "fem_knd_000764", ch = "knd"}
            },
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"香奈"},
                    "「可是，世间的蠢货们会那么想吗？」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00113",
        linknext = "block_00115"
    },
    block_00115 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            vo = {
                {"vo", file = "fem_knd_000765", ch = "knd"}
            },
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"香奈"},
                    "「天才的价值啊，大众是不懂的。那些家伙不管走到哪儿，都只会",
                    {"rt2"},
                    "被周围的评价裹挟着，凭感觉来决定自己的评价」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00114",
        linknext = "block_00116"
    },
    block_00116 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            vo = {
                {"vo", file = "fem_knd_000766", ch = "knd"}
            },
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"香奈"},
                    "「天才的价值，只有才人才懂」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00115",
        linknext = "block_00117"
    },
    block_00117 = {
        {"bg", file = "ev_com_j04_05", sync = 0, face = 1, time = 400, path = ":ev/ev_com_j04/", set = "ev_com_j04"},
        {"text"},
        text = {
            vo = {
                {"vo", file = "fem_knd_000767", ch = "knd"}
            },
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"香奈"},
                    "「只有像我这样，才华半吊子、成不了天才、却又算不上凡人的人，",
                    {"rt2"},
                    "才能明白」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00116",
        linknext = "block_00118"
    },
    block_00118 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"直哉"},
                    "「你从前不是张口凡人闭口凡人的自称吗，现在已经不是凡人了？」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00117",
        linknext = "block_00119"
    },
    block_00119 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            vo = {
                {"vo", file = "fem_knd_000768", ch = "knd"}
            },
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"香奈"},
                    "「我也算努力过来的。好歹是个才人了」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00118",
        linknext = "block_00120"
    },
    block_00120 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"直哉"},
                    "「那么？　你为什么这么执着于御樱禀？是喜欢上那家伙了吗？」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00119",
        linknext = "block_00121"
    },
    block_00121 = {
        {"bg", file = "ev_com_j04_04", sync = 0, face = 1, time = 400, path = ":ev/ev_com_j04/", set = "ev_com_j04"},
        {"text"},
        text = {
            vo = {
                {"vo", file = "fem_knd_000769", ch = "knd"}
            },
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"香奈"},
                    "「喜欢啊。但比起喜欢，恨意更深」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00120",
        linknext = "block_00122"
    },
    block_00122 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            vo = {
                {"vo", file = "fem_knd_000770", ch = "knd"}
            },
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"香奈"},
                    "「才人爱着天才，也恨着天才」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00121",
        linknext = "block_00123"
    },
    block_00123 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"直哉"},
                    "「原来如此，这份爱恨，简直就像《莫扎特传》里，莫扎特和安东",
                    {"rt2"},
                    "尼奥·萨列里的关系……」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00122",
        linknext = "block_00124"
    },
    block_00124 = {
        {"bg", file = "ev_com_j04_01", sync = 0, face = 1, time = 400, path = ":ev/ev_com_j04/", set = "ev_com_j04"},
        {"text"},
        text = {
            vo = {
                {"vo", file = "fem_knd_000771", ch = "knd"}
            },
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"香奈"},
                    "「啊，那部电影，我小时候也看过。天才莫扎特和才人萨列里的故",
                    {"rt2"},
                    "事」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00123",
        linknext = "block_00125"
    },
    block_00125 = {
        {"bg", file = "ev_com_j04_04", sync = 0, face = 1, time = 400, path = ":ev/ev_com_j04/", set = "ev_com_j04"},
        {"text"},
        text = {
            vo = {
                {"vo", file = "fem_knd_000772", ch = "knd"}
            },
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"香奈"},
                    "「莫扎特绝世的音乐才华受万众称颂，而他天真烂漫又粗俗无礼的",
                    {"rt2"},
                    "人品，却遭到其他作曲家的鄙夷」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00124",
        linknext = "block_00126"
    },
    block_00126 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            vo = {
                {"vo", file = "fem_knd_000773", ch = "knd"}
            },
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"香奈"},
                    "「然而唯独萨列里一人，参透了“莫扎特的才华是蒙受神之宠爱、独",
                    {"rt2"},
                    "一无二的至高之物”，也因此被迫认清，自己只有能看懂莫扎特真正",
                    {"rt2"},
                    "价值的才华，不过是个才人」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00125",
        linknext = "block_00127"
    },
    block_00127 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            vo = {
                {"vo", file = "fem_knd_000774", ch = "knd"}
            },
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"香奈"},
                    "「于是，被对莫扎特的强烈嫉妒所煎熬的萨列里，他的苦恼酿成了",
                    {"rt2"},
                    "巨大的悲剧」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00126",
        linknext = "block_00128"
    },
    block_00128 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            vo = {
                {"vo", file = "fem_knd_000775", ch = "knd"}
            },
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"香奈"},
                    "「天才与才人。最难以跨越、也最充满爱恨的关系」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00127",
        linknext = "block_00129"
    },
    block_00129 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"直哉"},
                    "「你也会被那样的悲剧吞没的」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00128",
        linknext = "block_00130"
    },
    block_00130 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            vo = {
                {"vo", file = "fem_knd_000776", ch = "knd"}
            },
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"香奈"},
                    "「不，历史并非只属于天才」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00129",
        linknext = "block_00131"
    },
    block_00131 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            vo = {
                {"vo", file = "fem_knd_000777", ch = "knd"}
            },
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"香奈"},
                    "「有时候，才人也能凌驾于天才之上」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00130",
        linknext = "block_00132"
    },
    block_00132 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            vo = {
                {"vo", file = "fem_knd_000778", ch = "knd"}
            },
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"香奈"},
                    "「不，所谓天才，并不只是让我们这些才人战栗恐惧的存在，也可",
                    {"rt2"},
                    "以说是乘上了时代潮流的才人」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00131",
        linknext = "block_00133"
    },
    block_00133 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            vo = {
                {"vo", file = "fem_knd_000779", ch = "knd"}
            },
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"香奈"},
                    "「我一定会走到她所在的地方」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00132",
        linknext = "block_00134"
    },
    block_00134 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"直哉"},
                    "「……那还真是了不起」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00133",
        linknext = "block_00135"
    },
    block_00135 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"直哉"},
                    "「不过，你被无视了吧？」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00134",
        linknext = "block_00136"
    },
    block_00136 = {
        {"bg", file = "ev_com_j04_05", sync = 0, face = 1, time = 400, path = ":ev/ev_com_j04/", set = "ev_com_j04"},
        {"text"},
        text = {
            vo = {
                {"vo", file = "fem_knd_000780", ch = "knd"}
            },
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"香奈"},
                    "「！」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00135",
        linknext = "block_00137"
    },
    block_00137 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"直哉"},
                    "「你刚才说“跟那位也合不来”，指的就是御樱禀吧？　八成是你们",
                    {"rt2"},
                    "主动去接近，却被彻底无视了」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00136",
        linknext = "block_00138"
    },
    block_00138 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"直哉"},
                    "「大概就是这么回事吧？」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00137",
        linknext = "block_00139"
    },
    block_00139 = {
        {"bg", file = "ev_com_j04_03", sync = 0, face = 1, time = 400, path = ":ev/ev_com_j04/", set = "ev_com_j04"},
        {"text"},
        text = {
            vo = {
                {"vo", file = "fem_knd_000781", ch = "knd"}
            },
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"香奈"},
                    "「是呢……」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00138",
        linknext = "block_00140"
    },
    block_00140 = {
        {"bg", file = "ev_com_j04_04", sync = 0, face = 1, time = 400, path = ":ev/ev_com_j04/", set = "ev_com_j04"},
        {"text"},
        text = {
            vo = {
                {"vo", file = "fem_knd_000782", ch = "knd"}
            },
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"香奈"},
                    "「可是艺术的历史，并非只属于天才」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00139",
        linknext = "block_00141"
    },
    block_00141 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            vo = {
                {"vo", file = "fem_knd_000783", ch = "knd"}
            },
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"香奈"},
                    "「我说过很多次了，创造历史的不只是天才」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00140",
        linknext = "block_00142"
    },
    block_00142 = {
        {"bg", file = "ev_com_j04_01", sync = 0, face = 1, time = 400, path = ":ev/ev_com_j04/", set = "ev_com_j04"},
        {"text"},
        text = {
            vo = {
                {"vo", file = "fem_knd_000784", ch = "knd"}
            },
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"香奈"},
                    "「近日之内，我们就要完成对草薙健一郎的超越」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00141",
        linknext = "block_00143"
    },
    block_00143 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"直哉"},
                    "「超越草薙健一郎？」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00142",
        linknext = "block_00144"
    },
    block_00144 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            vo = {
                {"vo", file = "fem_knd_000785", ch = "knd"}
            },
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"香奈"},
                    "「没错。媒体一定会大肆喧腾的」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00143",
        linknext = "block_00145"
    },
    block_00145 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"直哉"},
                    "「那是，什么意思……」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00144",
        linknext = "block_00146"
    },
    block_00146 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            vo = {
                {"vo", file = "fem_knd_000786", ch = "knd"}
            },
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"香奈"},
                    "「谁知道呢。不过，跟草薙君说这些，本身就已经很没意义了吧」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00145",
        linknext = "block_00147"
    },
    block_00147 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"直哉"},
                    "「没意义？」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00146",
        linknext = "block_00148"
    },
    block_00148 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            vo = {
                {"vo", file = "fem_knd_000787", ch = "knd"}
            },
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"香奈"},
                    "「大概，我只是想让自己，亲自确认一下罢了」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00147",
        linknext = "block_00149"
    },
    block_00149 = {
        {"bg", file = "ev_com_j04_05", sync = 0, face = 1, time = 400, path = ":ev/ev_com_j04/", set = "ev_com_j04"},
        {"text"},
        text = {
            vo = {
                {"vo", file = "fem_knd_000788", ch = "knd"}
            },
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"香奈"},
                    "「真够蠢的。亡灵？是呢。我想大概就是亡灵之类的东西吧」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00148",
        linknext = "block_00150"
    },
    block_00150 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            vo = {
                {"vo", file = "fem_knd_000789", ch = "knd"}
            },
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"香奈"},
                    "「不过，亲眼见到了你这副空壳一样的人，我反而看清了」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00149",
        linknext = "block_00151"
    },
    block_00151 = {
        {"bg", file = "ev_com_j04_04", sync = 0, face = 1, time = 400, path = ":ev/ev_com_j04/", set = "ev_com_j04"},
        {"text"},
        text = {
            vo = {
                {"vo", file = "fem_knd_000790", ch = "knd"}
            },
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"香奈"},
                    "「根本没必要对你这种人放什么狠话」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00150",
        linknext = "block_00152"
    },
    block_00152 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            vo = {
                {"vo", file = "fem_knd_000791", ch = "knd"}
            },
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"香奈"},
                    "「对我来说，你是过去的亡灵。如今，不过是幻影一般的东西」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00151",
        linknext = "block_00153"
    },
    block_00153 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"直哉"},
                    "「幻影吗……人明明就在你眼前，这话说得可真够重的」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00152",
        linknext = "block_00154"
    },
    block_00154 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            vo = {
                {"vo", file = "fem_knd_000792", ch = "knd"}
            },
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"香奈"},
